{"spread": 41, "blocks": [[{"t": "Project Sherlock is still unfolding, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 61, 194, 75]}, {"t": "yet the lessons are clear. Progress in ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 73, 210, 87]}, {"t": "conservation comes from precision ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 85, 204, 99]}, {"t": "and restraint. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 97, 99, 111]}], [{"t": "As each shophouse reopens, fa\u00e7ades ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 121, 214, 135]}, {"t": "read as they always have while modern ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 133, 222, 147]}, {"t": "systems remain hidden.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 145, 146, 159]}, {"t": " ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 157, 34, 171]}, {"t": "Visitors will feel the history rather than ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 169, 222, 183]}, {"t": "the engineering, which is exactly the ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 181, 212, 195]}, {"t": "outcome Mint aims for.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 193, 142, 207]}], [{"t": "Together, BeyondX and Project Sherlock ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Medium", "size": 20.0, "color": "#F1583A", "bbox": [244, 60, 637, 88]}, {"t": "show that conservation engineering is ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Medium", "size": 20.0, "color": "#F1583A", "bbox": [244, 84, 619, 112]}, {"t": "craft and care in equal measure. Progress ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Medium", "size": 20.0, "color": "#F1583A", "bbox": [244, 108, 649, 136]}, {"t": "need not erase history. With agility, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Medium", "size": 20.0, "color": "#F1583A", "bbox": [244, 132, 593, 160]}, {"t": "precision, and respect for the past, Mint ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Medium", "size": 20.0, "color": "#F1583A", "bbox": [244, 156, 639, 184]}, {"t": "continues to make old bones find new ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Medium", "size": 20.0, "color": "#F1583A", "bbox": [244, 180, 616, 208]}, {"t": "beats.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Medium", "size": 20.0, "color": "#F1583A", "bbox": [244, 204, 304, 232]}]]}